# Loot Values & Pricing

## Split

- **Read**: `Poe2Live.LootValues` (Core) — ground item entities, filter state.
- **Price book**: `PoeNinjaPriceBook` (Overlay) — async fetch, cache, league-aware.
- **Logic**: `LootValueLogic` — threshold comparisons, highlight rules (testable).

## Performance

- Price fetch is **async** and **cached** — never block tick loop on HTTP.
- Item label specs built on world cadence; render thread uses specs + live position only.
- Respect user filter/threshold settings in `RadarSettings`.

## Display

- `ItemLabelSpec` in `WorldSnapshot` — name, value string, highlight flag.
- Don't spam labels — cap/count governed by settings and distance.

## Tests

`LootValueLogicTests`, `PoeNinjaPriceBookTests` — extend when changing valuation rules.
